  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "58",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ISA 58"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "58",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Memeza kakhulu, ungahawukeli, phakamisa izwi lakho njengecilongo, umemezele abantu bami isiphambeko sabo, nendlu kaJakobe izono zayo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kepha bayangifuna imihla ngemihla, bajabulela ukwazi izindlela zami njengesizwe esenza ukulunga, esingashiyi ukwahlulela kukaNkulunkulu waso; izimiso zomthetho bazicela Kimi; bayakujabulela ukusondela kuNkulunkulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bathi kungani sizile ukudla, kodwa wena ungaboni? Sicindezeleleni umphefumulo wethu, wena ungazi na? Bhekani, ngosuku lokuzila kwenu nifumana intokozo, nifune wonke umshikashika wenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bhekani, nizilela ukuxabana nokuxabana nokushaya ngesibhakela sobubi; akumelwe nizile ukudla njenganamuhla ukuze nizwakalise izwi lenu phezulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yilokhu ukuzila ukudla engikukhethileyo na? usuku lokuba umuntu acindezele umphefumulo wakhe na? Ingabe ukugebisa ikhanda lakhe njengenqe nokwendlala indwangu yamasaka nomlotha ngaphansi kwakhe? nithanda ukulubiza ngokuthi wusuku lokuzila noluthokozisayo kuJehova na?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lokhu akusikho ukuzila engikukhethileyo na? ukuthukulula izibopho zobubi, ukuthukulula imithwalo esindayo, lokukhulula abacindezelweyo, lokuphula wonke amajogwe?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akukhona yini ukunika olambileyo isinkwa sakho nokuletha abampofu abaxoshwa endlini yakho na? uma ubona onqunu, umembese; nokuthi ungazifihli enyameni yakho?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khona ukukhanya kwakho kuyakuphuma njengokusa, nokuphila kwakho kuyakuhluma masinyane; ukulunga kwakho kuyakuphumela phambi kwakho; inkazimulo kaJehova iyakuba ngumvuzo wakho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khona uyakubiza, uJehova aphendule; kufanele ubize, futhi uyothi: Nangu mina! Uma nisusa phakathi kwenu ijoka, nokukhomba ngomunwe, nokukhuluma okuyize;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Futhi uma welulela umphefumulo wakho kolambileyo futhi usuthise umphefumulo ocindezelweyo; khona ukukhanya kwakho kuyakuvela ebumnyameni, nobumnyama bakho bube njengemini enkulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJehova uyakukuhola njalo, asuthise umphefumulo wakho endaweni yokomisa, akhuluphalise amathambo akho; futhi uyoba njengensimu eniselwayo nanjengomthombo omanzi awo anganqamuki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Labo abayakuba ngabakho bayakwakha amanxiwa amadala; uyakubizwa ngokuthi: Umlungisi wezikhala, umlungisi wezindlela zokuhlala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uma ubuyisa unyawo lwakho esabathani, ukuze uthokoze ngosuku lwami olungcwele; ulibize isabatha ngokuthi injabulo, ingcwele kaJehova, idunyiswa; futhi umhloniphe ngokungenzi izindlela zakho futhi ungafuni okuthandwa nguwe futhi ungakhulumi amazwi akho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khona uyakuthokoza ngoJehova; ngiyakukwenza ukuba ukhwele ezindaweni eziphakemeyo zomhlaba, ngikusekele ngefa likayihlo uJakobe, ngokuba umlomo kaJehova ukhulumile.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
